OL,3,ADrugs at their fingertips, intense
OL,4,Apressure: Why child stars fall into
OL,5,Aaddiction
OL,6,
OL,7,FHayden Panettiere was 16 when drugs
OL,8,Ffirst arrived in her life in Hollywood.
OL,10,FAhead of a red carpet event for the hit
OL,11,Fseries Heroes, she has said someone on
OL,12,Fher team handed her a pill to help amp
OL,13,Fup her energy. The hit sci-fi NBC
OL,14,Fseries had catapulted the teen into a
OL,15,Fhousehold name - and that brought with
OL,16,Fit intense pressure and exhaustion she
OL,17,Fsays felt overwhelming.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
